<span id="S6.F4.9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dashed red</span> outlines denote predicted frames with <em id="S6.F4.9.4" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">no ground-truth image input</em>, produced solely from the model’s future tokens. LFG on current frames enjoys crisper predictions even than its teacher. </span></figcaption>
</figure>
