<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F7.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure A7</span>: </span><span id="S6.F7.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative comparison of depth prediction for six frames. LFG is able to decouple static and dynamic objects as it continues along the road, and future work will improve the sharpness of the last frames’ predictions. <span id="S6.F7.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dashed red</span> outlines denote predicted frames with <em id="S6.F7.7.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">no ground-truth image input</em>, produced solely from the model’s future tokens</span></figcaption>
</figure>
